
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`PRIM_ROTATION: number = 8`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer PRIM_ROTATION = 8;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_ROTATION has the value 8</p>
  <p>PRIM_ROTATION is used to get or set the prim&#39;s rotation.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>PrimParam</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>llSetPrimitiveParams</h2>
  <p><b> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSetPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llSetPrimitiveParams</a>(<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Rotation" target="_blank">&amp;#32;PRIM_ROTATION,&amp;#32;[rotation</a> rot ]); </b></p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>• rotation</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/rot" target="_blank">rot</a></td>
        <td>–</td>
        <td>Any valid rotation</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>When used with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSetPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llSetPrimitiveParams</a> &amp; <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSetLinkPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llSetLinkPrimitiveParams</a></p>
  <h2>llGetPrimitiveParams</h2>
  <p><b> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llGetPrimitiveParams</a>([ PRIM_ROTATION ]); </b></p>
  <p>Returns the list <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Rotation" target="_blank"> [rotation</a> rot ]</p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>• rotation</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/rot" target="_blank">rot</a></td>
        <td>–</td>
        <td>Any valid rotation</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h3>Caveats</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><b>rot</b> is always the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Viewer_coordinate_frames#global" target="_blank">global rotation</a>, even if the prim is a child or the root prim of an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Attachment" target="_blank">attachment</a>.</li>
    <li>PRIM_ROTATION incorrectly reports the avatars rotation when called on the root of an attached object. Use <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_ROT_LOCAL" target="_blank">PRIM_ROT_LOCAL</a> for the root prim instead.</li>
  </ul>
